{
  "sheet": "buffs",
  "about": "One row per BuffDef the mod registers. stat effects are applied in a RecalculateStats postfix (hooks sheet). perStack values multiply by the buff count. icon is a Deadlock HUD image (vtex) read from the player's install, or 'none' for hidden buffs. debuff=true buffs sit on enemies. critStacks: stacks a critical hit adds (0 = same as a normal hit). trigger*: what happens when a stacking debuff reaches triggerStacks (0 = never): triggerDamagePct to the target plus triggerTargets more enemies within triggerRadius, a triggerStun, triggerBuff applied to them, and the burn from dotDamagePct; triggerClears=true empties the stacks, false fires again every triggerStacks stacks. withBuff: another buff applied whenever this one is. slowResist: while the buff is on, that fraction of any slow is ignored. maxHealthAdd: max health per stack (Tag Team's reward). disarm: the buff also locks the victim's skills for its duration (vanilla DisableAllSkills: monsters can move but not attack). noGun: the hero's gun can't fire while it is on (Burrow, Dust Devil). melee: the hero's M1 punches with the gun row's melee numbers while it is on (Krill away), and riderBone is hidden. linearSlow: a negative moveSpeedAdd takes that fraction straight off the speed per stack (Gooed: -8% a stack, -40% at 5) instead of dividing. bossStatCut: bosses (champions) feel that fraction less of the buff's move and attack speed (0.5 = half). accelerationAdd / jumpPowerAdd: fraction added to acceleration / jump power (Goo Ball: -0.875 = an eighth of the grip, momentum; +0.8 = jumps 80% higher). jumpCountAdd: extra jumps while it is on (a double jump). vfx: our own visual (effects row of kind custom) shown on whoever carries the buff, started when it first lands (Gooed: goo dripping, more per stack), or none.",
